Speculative SDN:

Requirements:
- Python
- wandb account

Files:
- script for the complete speculative SDN code.
- script to generate all the experiments combination list to run in the cluster to save it later in text files format, 
- script to run the experiments in the cluster and store the results in text files, 
- script to store all the results in one excel sheet, 
- script to read the results from the excel sheet for plots and tables, 

